WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.013 --> 00:00:16.605
It was a hot day.

2
00:00:16.606 --> 00:00:20.921
Nora opened the freezer and looked inside.

3
00:00:20.922 --> 00:00:27.240
"Dad. There's no ice cream!" she complained.

4
00:00:27.241 --> 00:00:31.059
Her father looked up from his computer.

5
00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.912
"Do you want to make some?"

6
00:00:33.913 --> 00:00:37.661
"Homemade ice cream!" Nora cried.

7
00:00:37.662 --> 00:00:42.073
"Yes! Let's get started!"

8
00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:48.376
Nora helped her father gather all the ingredients.

9
00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:50.919
"Okay," Dad said.

10
00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:54.495
He was looking at a cookbook.

11
00:00:54.496 --> 00:00:57.159
"First we need egg yolks."

12
00:00:57.160 --> 00:01:06.416
Crack! Nora broke some eggs and scooped out the yolks.

13
00:01:06.417 --> 00:01:08.289
She put them in a bowl.

14
00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:12.718
Dad added sugar.

15
00:01:12.719 --> 00:01:20.486
Then he whisked everything together.

16
00:01:20.487 --> 00:01:30.800
Next Dad heated milk and vanilla in a pot.

17
00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:35.360
Then he slowly poured the liquid into the egg yolks.

18
00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:40.112
Nora stirred everything together.

19
00:01:40.113 --> 00:01:51.921
They cooked the mixture until it got thick.

20
00:01:51.922 --> 00:01:55.632
"Perfect," Dad said.

21
00:01:55.633 --> 00:01:59.572
"What's next?" Nora asked.

22
00:01:59.573 --> 00:02:03.403
"Now our mixture has to cool," Dad said.

23
00:02:03.404 --> 00:02:09.970
Nora sighed. "Will it take a really long time?"

24
00:02:09.971 --> 00:02:15.729
"Nope," said Dad.

25
00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:17.793
"Watch this."

26
00:02:17.794 --> 00:02:21.492
He put the pot in ice water.

27
00:02:21.493 --> 00:02:26.452
"It's cooling fast!" Nora said.

28
00:02:26.453 --> 00:02:30.310
"Yep."

29
00:02:30.311 --> 00:02:34.609
Dad took a cold container out of the freezer.

30
00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:38.768
"What's that for?" Nora asked.

31
00:02:38.769 --> 00:02:42.913
"It's for an ice cream machine," Dad said.

32
00:02:42.914 --> 00:02:46.673
"The machine will churn the mixture for us."

33
00:02:46.674 --> 00:02:51.090
"Cool!" Nora said.

34
00:02:51.091 --> 00:02:57.554
Dad showed Nora how to put the container into the machine.

35
00:02:57.555 --> 00:03:01.825
He poured in the mixture and Nora added heavy cream.

36
00:03:01.826 --> 00:03:04.615
Then they turned on the machine.

37
00:03:04.616 --> 00:03:14.113
Twenty minutes later Dad turned it off.

38
00:03:14.114 --> 00:03:18.585
He covered the container and put it back into the freezer.

39
00:03:18.586 --> 00:03:21.712
"Here comes the hard part," Dad said.

40
00:03:21.713 --> 00:03:25.614
"We wait!"

41
00:03:25.615 --> 00:03:29.129
"Ugh," Nora groaned.

42
00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:32.414
"I hate waiting."

43
00:03:32.415 --> 00:03:35.179
"Me too," said Dad.

44
00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:39.268
"So let's try to stay busy."

45
00:03:39.269 --> 00:03:42.445
Dad and Nora played cards.

46
00:03:42.446 --> 00:03:46.184
They kicked a soccer ball around.

47
00:03:46.185 --> 00:03:50.848
They went for a long bike ride through the neighborhood.

48
00:03:50.849 --> 00:03:55.499
Back at home Dad opened the freezer.

49
00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:58.946
Nora stood behind him on tiptoes.

50
00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:02.862
"Is it ready?" she asked eagerly.

51
00:04:02.863 --> 00:04:06.096
"Yes!" Dad said.

52
00:04:06.097 --> 00:04:13.018
He scooped some ice cream and they tasted it.

53
00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:17.470
"Mmm," Nora said, grinning.

54
00:04:17.471 --> 00:04:20.503
"I'm glad there was no ice cream in the freezer.

55
00:04:20.504 --> 00:04:30.021
Homemade ice cream is much better!"
